    "title": "How can i watch wrestlemania 2026? Wrestlemania 42 matches night 1, 2",
    "text": "How can i watch wrestlemania 2026? Wrestlemania 42 matches night 1, 2We are officially one week away.WWE is preparing for WrestleMania 42, a two-night event featuring the biggest stars of the promotion. The card features the biggest names in the game, and the shows are loaded with huge matches.AdvertisementHere's everything you need to know about WrestleMania 42.100 WrestleMania thoughts: 100 thoughts on WrestleMania 42. WrestleMania predictions, hot takesWhen is WrestleMania 42?WrestleMania 42 will be held April 18 and 19.Where is WrestleMania 42?WrestleMania 42 will be held at Allegiant Stadium in Las Vegas.What time will WrestleMania 42 start?WrestleMania 42 is slated to start at 6 p.m. each night.Where to watch WrestleMania 42The first hour of each night of WrestleMania 42 will air on cable. On Saturday, the first hour of the show will air on ESPN 2. On Sunday, the first hour will air on ESPN. The entire card will air on ESPN Unlimited.AdvertisementWho is hosting WrestleMania?John Cena will host WrestleMania 42.Night 1 cardCody Rhodes vs. Randy Orton for the Undisputed ChampionshipStephanie Vaquer vs. Liv Morgan for the WWE Women's World ChampionshipThe Usos and LA Knight vs. Austin Theory, Logan Paul and IShowSpeedDrew McIntyre vs. Jacob Fatu, unsanctioned matchSeth Rollins vs. GuntherAJ Lee vs. Becky Lynch for the Women's Intercontinental ChampionshipNight 2 cardCM Punk vs. Roman Reigns for the World Heavyweight ChampionshipJade Cargill vs. Rhea Ripley for the WWE Women's ChampionshipBrock Lesnar vs. Oba FemiSami Zayn vs. Trick Williams for the United States ChampionshipPenta vs. Je'Von Evans vs. Dragon Lee vs. JD McDonagh vs. Rusev in a ladder match for the WWE championshipFinn Balor vs. Dominik MysterioNIa Jax and Lash Legend vs. Charlotte Flair and Alexa Bliss vs. Bayley and Lyra Valkyria vs. the Bella Twins for the WWE Women's Tag Team championship.Will the Rock be at WrestleMania?It doesn't appear so, so in wrestling, that means it's entirely possible.What matches will air on ESPN?On Saturday night, Logan Paul, Austin Theory and IShowSpeed vs. The Usos and LA Knight, and Jacob Fatu vs. Drew McIntyre will air on ESPN2. On Sunday, Brock Lesnar vs. Oba Femi and the Intercontinential Championship ladder match will air on ESPN. The rest of the card will air on ESPN Unlimited.This article originally appeared on Asbury Park Press: Wrestlemania times. Where to watch WrestleMania 42. WrestleMania card",
